le glyph but the boolean intersection of the tiled glyph with the periodic seam scaffold.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/23/code.py:232:    - If two beams meet before that, preserve the source task's collision behavior: 90-degree meetings create a blank intersection and redirect to the bisector, while 45-degree meetings become a zigzag. Any redirected beam still obeys its remaining budget.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/23/code.py:777:            common = sorted(set(available_by_block[i]).intersection(available_by_block[j]))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/623ea044.py:28:    - The lone pixel provides both the intersection point and the color for the two full\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/3/code.py:556:        if not matched.intersection(turning_candidates):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/dbc1a6ce.py:174:    \"\"\"Choose shared row/column marker intersections for the requested degrees.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/dbc1a6ce.py:217:    \"\"\"Choose line degrees, isolated markers, and shared intersections.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/21/code.py:17:    - 保留原题的局部几何机制：每条活动线仍由两枚同色 marker 决定周期，aligned companion 只决定截断范围，off-beat bystander 保持不变。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/9/code.py:3:# Name: 两轮优先级叠加\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/13/code.py:19:#    是“截断并改色”还是不存在。这里改成同一轴的两侧同时开火，每条活跃行/列都带有\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/c1d99e64.py:65:# Foreground density over nonblank row/column intersections.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/21/code.py:79:#      separated in both row intervals and columns, intersections stay readable.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/7b6016b9.py:187:def _gen_segment_intersections(h_segments, v_segments):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/7b6016b9.py:227:    intersections = _gen_segment_intersections(h_segments, v_segments)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/