ld reject the pair.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/78332cb0/1/code.py:39:#    - Original matching predicate used edge-set intersection > 0. That is false now because true\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/78332cb0/1/code.py:40:#      neighbors usually have zero shared-color overlap; complement, not intersection, defines a link.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/78332cb0/1/code.py:195:    common = set.intersection(*color_sets)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/136b0064/16/code.py:47:#      other self-intersections so the output stays legible.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/78332cb0/16/code.py:45:#    - The source adjacency test only required a non-empty intersection on one offset. That is\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a251c730/3/code.py:430:    - Stamp the sprite so its geometric-center cell lands on every same-color row/column intersection, then return the cropped destination rectangle.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/28/code.py:66:#    - 颜色不编码任何顺序、优先级或匹配关系；几何位置本身就是规则线索。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/35/code.py:51:#      不使用颜色 id 大小、黑色优先级等人类不可视因素。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/78332cb0/14/code.py:47:#    - The old chain test `intersection > 0` is no longer sufficient. It must\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/78332cb0/14/code.py:48:#      become `intersection == 2`, otherwise the fused task collapses back to\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/d8e07eb2/4/code.py:47:#   被查询家族的全部副本要么正好构成目标 open line，要么正好落在被空格截断的 blocked line 内。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/78332cb0/12/code.py:73:#    - each seam intersection has size 1;\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/78332cb0/D1/0/code.py:34:#    - Original ok(a,b) tested set intersection > 0. This is invalid now; complement is the intended relation and\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/78332cb0/D3/1/code.py:173:    common = set.intersection(*color_sets)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/78332cb0/D3/1/code.py:233:    common = set.intersection(*color_sets)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8f215267/13/code.py:26:#   5. 若真实输入中的计数超过可容纳长度，solver 仍做安全截断；生成器不会触发该分支。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/36a08778/24/code.py:21:#   2. 至少一条内部支流被蓝色排水口截断，保证与“无排水口版本”存在可量化差异。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/78332cb0/D4/0/code.py:47:    - 仍保留 3 块和 4 块两档，保证能看到“二维展开 + 截断空位”这两个可观察现象。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/78332cb0/D4/0/code.py:60:    - 3 块样例的空格位置固定在左下角，使“蛇形展开被截断”成为稳定、可学习的结构线索。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/29/code.py:45:#    overwrite interactions at intersections.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/23/code.py:23:#       被截断到交点；但先手已经铺开的填充不回退，因此链式因果在最终输出里仍可见。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/23/code.py:43:#       截断”的时序线索。此组合改为：射线状态会被截断，但已落下的早期填充不回滚。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/42/code.py:147:            if footprints[i].intersection(footprints[j]):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/7/code.py:3:# Name: 镜像交替严格截断\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/247ef758/29/code.py:58:#   left source blob remains, lines emanate rightward, and only some marker intersections are used.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/11/code.py:173:#    intersections and keeps the cropped output readable.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/247ef758/26/code.py:16:#   intersections of those projection lines.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/247ef758/26/code.py:87:#   line, with same-parity top columns and sc > bc so intersections are integral.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/247ef758/26/code.py:254:    - Target centers come from intersections of top+left \"/\" projections and\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8698868d/11/code.py:68:  visible frames occupy all non-corridor rows x cols slot intersections, so they never overlap\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/247ef758/27/code.py:45:#   - 目标点的最近边若出现平局，solver 必须有确定 tie-break；这里固定优先级 top/left/bottom/right。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/45/code.py:38:#    - The generator chooses every anchor from the intersection of:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/39/code.py:19:#      会先占住共享格，br 到达该格前一轮后便被截断。于是输出里同时出现：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/39/code.py:24:#      至少有 1 个组件真的被另一条路径截断。这样变化不是装饰性的。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/39/code.py:35:#      然后把这个相位用于被截断后的前缀。生成器显式保证外部 alternating 轨迹和完整候选路的奇偶兼容。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/39/code.py:43:#      只有当“最短避障路存在 + 至少一条真的绕障 + 同步模拟里至少一条真的被截断”时才接受。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/1/code.py:137:    \"\"\"Return the unique full-row/full-col divider intersection.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a395ee82/14/code.py:3:# Name: 多色模板覆盖优先级\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/247ef758/10/code.py:26:#    and among the 2x2 apparent intersections only the matched-order diagonal is used.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/7/code.py:25:#   therefore chosen from the intersection of \"local motif fits\" and \"incoming motif\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/7/code.py:80:    \"\"\"Return the unique full-row/full-col divider intersection.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/42/code.py:120:    \"\"\"Return the unique full-row/full-col divider intersection.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/38/code.py:35:#    quadrant, and chooses anchor positions from the intersection of \"anchor fits\" and \"whole motif fits\".\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/36/code.py:3:# Name: 共享颜色多色精灵优先级修复\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8f3a5a89/5/code.py:43:#    - Targets are restricted to interior intersections of row/column sweeps.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/22/code.py:3:# Name: 共享颜色优先级处理\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/247ef758/6/code.py:32:#      the order-matched intersections are used.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/2/code.py:47:#    - It chooses TL anchor coordinates from the intersection of:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/247ef758/30/code.py:67:#   样例稳定归纳“同色匹配后在交叉点复制”这一规则。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/247ef758/30/code.py:119:      intersection, with lower source sprites stamped first\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/16/code.py:62:#    - Anchor positions are sampled from the intersection that keeps both lobes fully inside the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/14/code.py:3:# Name: 重叠精灵优先级修复\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/247ef758/12/code.py:240:    - read the same marker-defined row/column intersections as the original task\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D9/2/code.py:27:#     - 仍保留 2-4 个容器、0-1 个满橙 decoy、四个朝向、灰色数截断等原题自由度。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D9/2/code.py:32:#     - `paste(..., clip=True)` 在原题里只是保护；在本变体里会静默截断真正需要扩展的像素，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D2/1/code.py:11:#   `steps = grey_count`，目标线只负责给出朝向，不再截断位移。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D2/1/code.py:30:# - 原 solver 里 `steps = min(distance, grey_count)` 的“distance 截断”此前顺带保证了不会越过目标。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/25/code.py:49:#      pair and moderate bbox intersection, so walls remain readable after noise damage.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D19/0/code.py:2:# Dimension: D19 — 线段绘制优先级 (multi_step)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/34/code.py:37:#    - The target anchor position is chosen from the intersection of all fit constraints, and a\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D19/1/code.py:2:# Dimension: D19 — 线段绘制优先级 (multi_step)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D19/1/code.py:4:#         变为：主线和阴影线混合后按线段长度从长到短统一绘制，仍然只占用背景格，因此长线会在交叉点优先“抢占”像素。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D19/1/code.py:26:#    顶边及其阴影长 8，竖边及其阴影长 4。原题在交叉点 (1,7) 保留主竖边颜色；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D19/1/code.py:39:#    - 原 main 里“先主后阴影”是硬编码优先级。这里把主/阴影都收集成 jobs，再按长度统一排序。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D19/1/code.py:40:#    - 旧版 _make_shape_patch 直接先画完整主形状、再整体平移阴影，这依赖旧优先级；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D19/1/code.py:45:#    从而保证不同组在最终输出中不相交、不贴边，也不会出现跨组优先级竞争。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D19/1/code.py:52:#    只要求一个“优先级矩形”承担 D19 现象，其余对象延续原题的稀疏布局，避免全图大量覆盖而难以读图。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D19/2/code.py:2:# Dimension: D19 — 线段绘制优先级 (multi_step)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/30/code.py:118:    \"\"\"Return the unique full-row/full-col divider intersection.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D8/3/code.py:34:#    patch 的 bbox 覆盖了主射线和可能出现的平行射线，因此放置时不会截断。全局仍保留 >=1 的\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/14/code.py:16:#    - 对每个被遮挡像素，solver 不再收集整条 LR/UD 轨道的可见值，而是按固定优先级逐层尝试：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/14/code.py:33:#    - 原生成器只需保证“整条 LR/UD 轨道全被挡住”时有转置备份；融合后必须逐像素保证优先级链中最早可见的那一层存在，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/0934a4d8/14/code.py:48:#    - 没有颜色置换规则；颜色只通过空间对应关系重复出现。解题者需要推断的是位置优先级链，而不是颜色 id 含义。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D8/2/code.py:23:#       右上等顶点仍以孤立输入点形式保留。阴影只沿这些“截断射线”平移复制。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D8/2/code.py:35:#       - 阴影阶段原来平移完整边；现在必须平移截断后的射线，否则会错误延伸到旧终点。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D8/2/code.py:39:#       - generator 必须保证截断射线和其平移阴影在输入中途不撞上非背景像素，否则 solver 会合法地跳过该射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D1/1/code.py:11:#    - plus: 5 格十字，中心在交叉点\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/9/code.py:26:          = #straight spans between adjacent intersections.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/89565ca0/9/code.py:241:    - Also count the independent wall segments between adjacent intersections; this determines the filled length of the row.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/35ab12c3/10/code.py:60:#    The grid stays readable because cross-object intersections are still forbidden;\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D12/0/code.py:73:#      intersections.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D3/1/code.py:29:#    - _draw_line_bg_only 依赖“主形状先画、阴影后画，主形状优先级更高”；MST 仍适用。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5545f144/25/code.py:3:# Name: 优先级方向+方向颜色轨迹+累积旋转\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/17/code.py:40:#     - 原代码输出从输入网格上“擦除再贴回”；融合后如果目标坐标为负数或超边界，这种做法会截断对象。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5545f144/1/code.py:3:# Name: 优先级方向+多方向最近\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5545f144/1/code.py:94:#   path with the same nearest-then-priority chooser used in the solver and by\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/33/code.py:5:# Name: 方向指示精灵 + 颜色编码优先级 + 链式传递\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/abc82100/33/code.py:3:# Name: 模板不同颜色区分+堆叠优先级\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/abc82100/3/code.py:47:#      intersections of active rows and active columns are kept empty.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/abc82100/3/code.py:54:#    intersections. This prevents accidental extra legends and guarantees the solver's\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/abc82100/37/code.py:3:# Name: 堆叠优先级编码+同色条件分支\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D6/0/code.py:33:#     - 不引入新的颜色、对象类别或多种优先级规则；优先级只由“谁离共享目标更近”决定。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/291dc1e1/3/code.py:3:# Name: 面积排序+少数色优先级\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D6/0/code.py:2:# Dimension: D6 — 阴影优先级规则 (transform)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D6/1/code.py:2:# Dimension: D6 — 阴影优先级规则 (transform)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D6/1/code.py:20:#   therefore intersection cells remain 2.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D6/1/code.py:66:#   marker with a structural cue: it appears exactly on shape/shadow intersections.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/abc82100/41/code.py:23:#      Every interior marker pixel sits at the intersection of one active row and\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/abc82100/41/code.py:63:#      intersections.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/abc82100/41/code.py:90:#      intersection, and bystanders never use the shared source marker color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/abc82100/41/code.py:202:    Read color labels from the left edge and stencil labels from the top edge, then fuse them at interior intersections.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/abc82100/41/code.py:208:    - Interior source pixels are the shared marker color and appear at intersections of active rows and active columns.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/abc82100/41/code.py:320:        raise ValueError(\"not enough source intersections\")\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D6/2/code.py:2:# Dimension: D6 — 阴影优先级规则 (transform)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D6/2/code.py:24:#   shadow color, and cells in the intersection become background. This creates visible\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5545f144/6/code.py:93:#   continuation markers are exactly the intersection of the per-frame marker\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/2/code.py:3:# Name: 多色连接器 + 颜色编码优先级\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/291dc1e1/15/code.py:85:#   identifies the edge intersection. Generator guarantee: canonical scene writes\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D14/2/code.py:27:#    - 主边绘制、平行复制、背景优先级规则不依赖距离 1，本变体中仍成立，因此保持不动。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D10/0/code.py:48:#    - Each patch is self-validated: no self-intersection, no direct non-consecutive\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c4d067a0/22/code.py:3:# Name: 图例放大叠加+颜色优先级\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/29/code.py:10:#     fused: 输入改成极端宽/高矩形；输出先只向“真正截断射线的短轴边”扩展，再让射线继续画到新边界\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/18/code.py:254:    intersection_cells = sum(1 for colors in visits.values() if len(colors) >= 2)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/18/code.py:264:        \"intersection_count\": intersection_cells,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/18/code.py:464:    if metrics[\"intersection_count\"] < MIN_INTERSECTION_CELLS:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D21/0/code.py:3:# Change: 阴影超出网格边界时直接截断（不画超出部分），使用bounds check确保所有坐标在[0,H)x[0,W)内... → 环绕边界（toroidal）\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/25/code.py:31:    - 原题/阻挡逻辑里：A 的 BR 会先占住通道，B 的 TL 在第一批已画像素处就停止，C 也只会被更早像素截断\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/26/code.py:22:    - 截断自由度控制为“每条射线仅保留一个从端点出发的连续前缀”，不允许空洞或多段残留，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D21/1/code.py:3:# Change: 阴影超出网格边界时直接截断（不画超出部分），使用bounds check确保所有坐标在[0,H)x[0,W)内... → 边界反射\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D21/2/code.py:3:# Change: 阴影超出网格边界时直接截断（不画超出部分），使用bounds check确保所有坐标在[0,H)x[0,W)内\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D21/2/code.py:23:#    因为终点 c=19 出界，整条阴影边不画；D21 则会画到 (8,18) 为止，形成一条被右边界截断的阴影。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D21/2/code.py:60:#    识别。它还假设对象之间留有缓冲，所以截断后的阴影前缀不会撞进别的对象；生成器用输出占用检测保证这点。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/42/code.py:43:      - 颜色优先级在所有样例里都可见且重复；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/42/code.py:78:    可见的颜色优先级，而不是不可观察的隐藏排序。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/8/code.py:47:    - solver 假设完整射线路径上不会被别的对象意外截断；generator 用完整路径占位保证。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/17/code.py:69:    - 多个颜色在交叉处出现覆盖，且哪个颜色压住别人会在不同样例里稳定遵循同一颜色优先级。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/17/code.py:70:    - 颜色优先级虽然内部实现为升序，但生成器固定反复使用少量颜色 {1,2,3,4} 并制造交叉，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c416de3/16/code.py:495:    shared = set(frames[sources[0]][\"patterns\"]).intersection(set(frames[sources[1]][\"patterns\"]))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/26/code.py:33:#     - 因而同一张输出里同时出现两类证据：中带障碍保持原色并截断光束，侧带障碍内部出现青色通道。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/15/code.py:38:  - 覆盖对使用不同的线段颜色，否则即使发生覆盖，肉眼也看不出优先级\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/15/code.py:54:  - 覆盖对故意做成“上方先画、下方后改色”，少量样例就能看出顺序优先级\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/18/code.py:13:#   本融合版则只补到 (3,6) 为止，(5,6) 保持背景、(6,6) 仍是原始蓝端点，于是既能看见 L 形拐角，也能看见被品红截断的空尾巴。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/18/code.py:35:#   solver 假设若一条真实段被障碍截断，则障碍后至少留有 1 个背景尾格再到下端点；生成器从 `path[corner+1:-2]` 中选障碍位置来保证可见空尾。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/31/code.py:24:#    - 如果不同段或射线重叠, 渐变优先级会变得含糊。生成器因此禁止路径/射线之间的输出重叠。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/8/code.py:47:#    in-bounds, and rejects layouts whose required intersections land on occupied cells.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/3/code.py:86:#      self-intersections beyond the intended elbow overwrite.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/3/code.py:30:#     - 生成器固定每条主线放 1 个真实触发点，并要求至少 2 条主线，以稳定出现“反射+截断”的可见组合效果。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/3/code.py:33:#     - 原发射循环隐含“各射线互不影响、顺序不重要”也失效；若继续逐条画到底，先画的射线会不公平地截断后画的射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/3/code.py:48:#     - 这样解题者能在少量样例里同时看到“比原题多出的同向延伸”和“没有画到边界而是被别的线截断”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/35/code.py:72:#      self-intersection that the collision rule already forbids. The generator\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/11/code.py:272:    - The blue pair no longer defines a single segment; it defines a two-branch structure. The output must therefore reason about branch membership first, then apply a shared “intersection becomes special” rule to both blue-blue and blue-ray collisions.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6e4f6532/9/code.py:40:#     full constant row or column. That fails at the cross intersection, so the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D1/1/code.py:3:# Change: 红色标记处恢复线色并填充面对端点间的间隙；黄色标记处擦除旧臂并从端点通过标记延伸到网格边缘... → 射线截断而非延伸到边缘\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/4/code.py:88:#      rejected. This avoids layered multi-color intersections that would hide the fused rule.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/5/code.py:36:#    occupies the interior, so overlap remains limited to readable ray intersections.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9385bd28/20/code.py:3:# Name: 隐式颜色映射+面积编码优先级+无操作干扰\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/28/code.py:121:    - The dominant color is background. Blue pixels form an even-sized endpoint set, typically with two short pairs on one diagonal plus another pair on the perpendicular diagonal. Magenta pixels may sit on one matched segment or at an intersection shared by multiple matched segments.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/4/code.py:33:#    - The generator always includes at least one genuine mid-flight intersection, not\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/14/code.py:23:#     - 原 D9 单变体只需记录两种对角斜率；融合后还要新增横向与纵向两个方向家族，否则无法识别红色十字与其交叉点。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/14/code.py:24:#     - 原题默认输出专用笔画互不相交；融合后第三步恰恰依赖交叉，因此 generator 要主动构造至少一个非触发交叉点。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/14/code.py:32:#     - 每个样例都强制存在主线中心交叉点，且该点不是输入触发器；这使第三步可被看成“所有交叉都变黄”，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/14/code.py:39:#       且至少一个非触发交叉点。generate_input() 通过“相交双主线 + 双真实触发器 + 预留所有笔画格”来保证这些前提。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/14/code.py:132:    - The puzzle now requires two independent inferences at once: trigger color chooses the branch geometry, and the final yellow marks are not input objects but late-stage intersection labels computed from the fully constructed line network.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/14/code.py:367:        non_trigger_intersections = [cell for cell, families in mark_map.items() if len(families) >= 2 and cell not in trigger_cells]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/14/code.py:368:        if center not in non_trigger_intersections:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/29/code.py:25:#   当两条 bar 都下一次命中列 8 的障碍时立即停止，不再继续到更远位置。差异正是“起点后移 + 远条覆盖 + 障碍截断”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/29/code.py:29:# - generator 强制至少一行出现真实覆盖，且每个活跃行的最近 bar 都会被障碍截断，这样 2-3 个样例就能同时观察到三项变化。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D12/1/code.py:28:#     - 原 main 里 `out = g.copy()` 隐含“输出尺寸不变”；变体下必须先创建更大的画布，否则所有新射线仍会被截断\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3e6067c3/17/code.py:67:  人类可以从少量例子中归纳出固定优先级。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/25/code.py:28:#      new rule: start on a row road -> enter an intersection -> if both forward and \"left\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/25/code.py:30:#      intersection take right -> stop exactly when the trace reaches the finish-colored cell.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/25/code.py:409:    - Path area: a thin network of horizontal and vertical corridors with visible intersections.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/25/code.py:526:    intersections = 0\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/25/code.py:538:                intersections += 1\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/25/code.py:539:    return intersections >= 4\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/faa9f03d/D14/0/code.py:17:#     - 对每个真实交叉点，输入里会同时出现“一条水平 1 格缺口”和“一条竖直 1 格缺口”，它们在同一格相交。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/11/code.py:36:# - 旧代码的距离截断曾隐含防越界；现在可能越过目标线，因此生成器按“输入容器 + 输入头线 +\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/33/code.py:43:- 原来按“离分隔条距离”排序是为了解决同一行 1-2 条色条的优先级；现在每行最多一个控制点，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/4/code.py:18:#    - 原题里，标记总在左边界，solver 用 R,D,L,U 邻居优先级选第一步；于是起步几乎等价于“从左向右”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/3/code.py:357:    - Each marker launches a particle in the first adjacent path direction using R,D,L,U priority and repaints path cells by advancing through the cycle.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/5/code.py:24:#       标记沿走廊前进，撞墙后按左右优先级转弯”这一条主线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/31f7f899/15/code.py:21:#    from the segment's intersection row with the baseline, not from x-position. The solver must:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/31f7f899/15/code.py:35:#    exactly one baseline intersection per object, which avoids ambiguous slot anchors, and excluding\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/31f7f899/15/code.py:72:#   centered diagonal segments, so every object has one unique intersection cell on the baseline.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/31f7f899/15/code.py:95:    - Preserve the vertical baseline, with the segment colors overwriting it at the intersection rows.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D13/0/code.py:24:    - 生成器必须构造至少一组会真正发生截断的菱形对，否则会退化回原题\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D13/0/code.py:35:    - 变体逻辑（顺序发射）: A 先画到 B 的 TL 线段外一格，B 再发射时第一步就撞到 A 的像素，因此 B 这两个 TL 端点都被截断\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D13/0/code.py:53:  - 生成器先造输入，再分别跑“顺序阻挡”和“独立阻挡”仿真；若无截断、或独立仿真出现异色覆盖冲突，则整例丢弃\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D13/0/code.py:58:  - 每个样例至少出现 2 个被截断的端点，确保 2-3 组样例就能看出“先处理的菱形会阻挡后处理的菱形”\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/13/code.py:29:#      在螺旋走廊里全部失效，所以相关的初始方向优先级、碰撞计数、交替左/右转逻辑都必须删除。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/17/code.py:48:#    - Shared intersection cells are dangerous recolor targets because multiple\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/17/code.py:76:#      shared intersections.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/23/code.py:79:#   background collision dots. There is no extra intersection symbol, so the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/23/code.py:391:    - The local particle dynamics are unchanged; the new inference burden is to notice that the two left-edge markers now occupy one shared corridor with no separator, so intersections are resolved by visible later-overwrites-earlier paint rather than by forbidding overlap.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/17/code.py:40:#   - `main()` uses first-adjacent-path priority R,D,L,U. For left-edge markers,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/17/code.py:311:    - Erase the template blocks and the end block in the output, then launch each marker along its first adjacent path cell using R,D,L,U priority.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/15/code.py:349:    - While tracing the wire, bare intersections obey straight-ahead priority. The only exception is a junction whose current travel axis is bracketed by one of those offset grey pairs: there, leave the vertical stem and take the unique side branch.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/17/code.py:24:#   但遇到障碍列 8 时同样停止，且不能把 8 改色。差异点是“后到先得覆盖”和“障碍不可覆盖且会截断”同时生效。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/17/code.py:48:# - 生成器要求至少一行同时体现“被障碍截断”和“后 bar 覆盖前 bar”，避免两个改动分别散落在不同样例角落里。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/22/code.py:127:def _priority_dir_grid(g: np.ndarray, r: int, c: int, path_color: int) -> str | None:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/22/code.py:365:        priority_dir = _priority_dir_grid(g, int(sr), int(sc), int(path_color))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/15/code.py:202:    - Each marker launches from its own cell using the first adjacent path cell in R,D,L,U priority order.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/2/code.py:21:#      因而“箭头提供默认 turn family，颜色决定是否真的执行这次 turn”，蓝色就是显式的优先级覆盖案例。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/2/code.py:58:#    - 蓝色交叉是关键：它与红色交叉共享同类箭头，但输出行为不同，因此解题者能从少量样例学到优先级而不是把箭头当唯一规则。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/16/code.py:16:#         于是蓝色只留下被截断的蓝色 trail，不再补到原本的远端。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/16/code.py:29:#      检查条带上的 9 是否仍可用，否则后续 token 会在矩形入口处被截断。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/16/code.py:35:#    - 生成器继续用 oracle 过滤，并额外检查成功路由数、被截断/改道数、长度档位数和与 D3-only 基线的差异。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/16/code.py:57:#    - 只有当 `combo_out` 与 `d3_out` 在同一输入上明显不同，且至少有一个后续 token 被截断或改道时才接受。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/2/code.py:19:# - 连续段不是整块写入，而是按射线方向逐格扫描：若遇到障碍色，则当前段立刻在障碍前截断，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/2/code.py:31:#   point/stop 会越过该障碍继续落点，而 dense/stop 会在段内被截断。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/13/code.py:9:#   1) D2/0：容器总是移动到目标线位置，步数 = 头线到目标线的纯几何距离，不再被灰格数截断。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/9/code.py:3:# Name: 目标线截断后裁剪\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/d35bdbdc/19/code.py:187:        assert nxt not in seen, \"grey loop self-intersection is not supported\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/4/code.py:55:# - 颜色不参与排序、优先级或路由判定；颜色只标识 token 身份，人类观察者可以纯靠几何追踪推断对应关系。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/24/code.py:23:- 生成器要求目标区域比截断前的完整填充至少少掉一个可见内核，避免 D4 退化成原题。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/67e490f4/D17/1/code.py:142:    shared = set.intersection(*color_sets)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/34/code.py:23:#      1) ext_side 上第一格和若干重叠格由“最远 bar”赢得，完全反转原题优先级；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/24/code.py:3:# Name: 高度决定数量+顶部截断\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/22/code.py:3:# Name: 离散像素计数决定优先级\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/6/code.py:33:  “每行 1-2 个 source object”的骨架，并强制至少一行出现 2 个控制点，让优先级仍有作用。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/6/code.py:43:  只是 `dist` 不再只是优先级，还同时成为步长本身。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f931b4a8/27/code.py:24:#    也就是从靠近内部拼接边的纹理反射出去，因此边缘不会像“硬截断”那样突然断开。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/bf45cf4b/20/code.py:54:#     - 人类从 2-4 组样例能直接看到：同一 tile 在奇数行横向错半块，且最右端会出现“被截断的砖”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/bf45cf4b/20/code.py:55:#     - tile 的非对称内部花纹让“半块截断”更明显，不会被左右镜像外观掩盖。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/4/code.py:25:#     intersection would erase every colored layer and collapse the task. The fused solver\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/28/code.py:506:                tight_blue = corridor_set.intersection(blue) if (steps_limit == 2 and not include_origin) else set()\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7ed72f31/19/code.py:3:# Name: 颜色优先级共享轴反射\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7ed72f31/5/code.py:30:#    - one monochrome payload in exactly one quadrant near their intersection.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7ed72f31/14/code.py:36:#    - 原代码把“混合组件”和“孤立红点”分两阶段处理；在 D8 中这只能作为发现顺序，不能再决定优先级。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b5ca7ac4/10/code.py:23:#    - \"Overlap means row intersection only\" changes to \"intersection or gap 0/1\".\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b5ca7ac4/20/code.py:3:# Name: 框架内优先级标记+颜色值排序\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b5ca7ac4/35/code.py:92:def _rect_intersection(a: tuple[int, int, int], b: tuple[int, int, int]) -> tuple[int, int]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b5ca7ac4/35/code.py:105:    h, w = _rect_intersection(a, b)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b5ca7ac4/35/code.py:193:    inter_h, inter_w = _rect_intersection(rect_a, rect_b)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c7dc4dd/21/code.py:18:#     但 solver 仍需靠任意优先级打破平局”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f931b4a8/10/code.py:52:#    观察者需要同时看到两种信号：中间接缝两侧互为镜像，以及最右/最下残块不是简单截断。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/3dc255db/D8/0/code.py:21:#   同轴、会发生阻挡的杯。这样样例里能直接看到“近中心的杯完整弹出，远中心的杯被截断”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/3dc255db/D8/1/code.py:25:#     - 因为别的杯可能已经占住交叉点，所以后来的杯会跳过该格，把自己的像素放到更远处，形成交错线\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/11/code.py:419:        if len(branch2) >= 2 and not placements.intersection(branch2):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/edb79dae/27/code.py:346:    common_left = set.intersection(*({cand[\"left\"], cand[\"right\"]} for cand in legend_candidates))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/edb79dae/8/code.py:244:    - The fused behavior is in the placement step: anchors expand into hollow contours, and nearby contours do not overwrite one another; their intersections vanish because overlap is treated as a binary XOR.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/edb79dae/1/code.py:219:    common_colors = set.intersection(*(cand[\"colors\"] for cand in legend_candidates))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/24/code.py:119:  - The generator rejects overlaps and self-intersections, so different arrows do\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/3dc255db/D3/0/code.py:38:#       不再依赖原题允许的截断溢出。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/58f5dbd5/13/code.py:24:#    intersection of all centered canonical motifs. Example: if a color has canonical masks A and B,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/58f5dbd5/13/code.py:29:#    Multi-step behavior is limited to 2-3 motifs per block color, enough to make the intersection\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/58f5dbd5/13/code.py:46:#    final preserved intersection would equal the naive \"use visible masks directly\" baseline.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/58f5dbd5/13/code.py:56:#    in any order yields the same intersection. The solver still recovers them in reading order so the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/58f5dbd5/13/code.py:222:    - Equivalently, the finished tile keeps exactly the intersection of all centered canonical motifs; then pack all finished 5x5 tiles with 1-cell gaps and a 1-cell bg border, preserving block row/column order.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/58f5dbd5/13/code.py:479:    \"\"\"Pick non-identity visible poses whose raw intersection differs from the canonical one.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/edb79dae/6/code.py:12:#      each row/column intersection is now a single-pixel anchor.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/edb79dae/6/code.py:21:#      uses TR alignment, so the same sprite grows in different directions from the two intersections.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/edb79dae/6/code.py:25:#      line of intended slots per color. That prevents ambiguous extra intersections.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/edb79dae/6/code.py:162:      projected intersections are single-pixel anchors inside the frame.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/17/code.py:82:# - The generator rejects self-intersections and unintended wall contacts, so the ray\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/2/code.py:39:#      因此 generator 保证每个接触点最多只有一个可触达墙；solver 仍保留固定优先级：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/29/code.py:36:      orientation and is translated into the split intersection's matching inner\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/29/code.py:95:    center fragment sits one cell away from the split intersection. This separation\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/29/code.py:250:    without mirroring and moved to the split intersection's inner corner.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/25/code.py:19:#    fg cell belongs to one of four quadrants relative to the split intersection.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/da515329/22/code.py:305:    - First reconstruct the same dense spiral skeleton as the base task: each arm tip launches a clockwise wall-following path with the original turn priority, 2/1 step schedule, and 1-cell spacing rule.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c3d4a41/D18/0/code.py:3:# Change: 彩色像素紧贴凸起顶部下方堆叠，受框架顶部内壁限制，多余像素被截断（保留底部的）... → 彩色像素从框架顶部开始向下堆叠\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/24/code.py:36:#    - Put a 5x5 ring around the split intersection. The split row/col pass through\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c3d4a41/D18/2/code.py:3:# Change: 彩色像素紧贴凸起顶部下方堆叠，受框架顶部内壁限制，多余像素被截断（保留底部的）... → 彩色像素居中放置\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/1/code.py:47:#    - Two-control samples enforce an integer line intersection inside the bbox so\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/1/code.py:606:                intersection: Coord | None = None\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/1/code.py:611:                    intersection = anchor\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/1/code.py:636:                        intersection,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/1/code.py:649:    r0, c0, ctrl_pts, metas, line_cells, intersection, region_counts, kept, vanish, edges, sum_meta, diff_meta = rng.choice(candidates)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/1/code.py:656:        segment = _pick_segment(cells, rng, include=intersection, min_len=3, max_len=4)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/22/code.py:33:#       - 不引入跨颜色配对、优先级、速度差或多次碰撞。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/26/code.py:3:# Name: 射线截断 + 长度消歧 + 先黄后红\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/35/code.py:22:        * 左/右区去对应交叉点的内角;\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/581f7754/9/code.py:27:#       mixed-axis crops and rail intersections.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/64efde09/8/code.py:285:      off-diagonal intersections reveal the mixing rule.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/39/code.py:30:#   * BL stays near the split intersection and turns alt;\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/6/code.py:31:- 原 solver 假设“触边区域一定只做平移”；融合后不成立，区域动作要由其接触到的控制边颜色决定，并处理双边接触时的优先级。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b99e7126/54/code.py:56:#     - 裁切窗口由 marker 决定并对整图边界做截断，因此不会越界。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D2/0/code.py:3:# Change: 交叉标记（crossing markers）——垂直管道通过水平管道的交叉处，用一对5号像素标记穿行管道的交叉点前后，表示'直行不转弯'；9号矩形块作为宽接合体直穿对面 → 反射镜代替直穿\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D2/0/code.py:20:#    - 这些 9 号块只会放在原本有 5 标记的真实十字交叉点上。原题在这里会让竖线直行穿过水平线；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D2/0/code.py:49:#    - solver 假设需要反射的 9 块位于可四向接线的位置；generator 用原 5 标记交叉点作为锚点并显式校验四个面。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:23:      - 具体地，若交叉点坐标满足 `(r + c) % 2 == 0`，则显示该交叉的优先色；否则显示另一条穿过该点的线色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:26:      - 例：橙线是一条竖直主干，依次与青色蛇形线在 4 个位置相交。原题会让青色因碎片更多而在 4 个交叉点全部可见。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:42:    - 黄色仍只放在端点外侧；其旧臂与新射线都不允许碰到任何交叉族，避免“黄射线全覆盖”与“棋盘格交替”在同一点争优先级。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:57:    - 同一点不会同时受黄射线和粉色家族控制；于是 solver 的优先级顺序 `yellow > pink-family parity > original single-color tie-break` 有构造性支撑。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/16/code.py:26:  2. 唯一不接壤控制边的象限不再消失, 而是移到 split 交叉点附近的中心区域。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/16/code.py:311:    center inner corner near the split intersection.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D2/1/code.py:3:# Change: 交叉标记（crossing markers）——垂直管道通过水平管道的交叉处，用一对5号像素标记穿行管道的交叉点前后，表示'直行不转弯'；9号矩形块作为宽接合体直穿对面\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D2/1/code.py:4:#   → 无标记交叉——优先级规则\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D2/1/code.py:10:#     new: remove those 5-cells entirely. Crossings are plain cyan '+' intersections. When a routed signal reaches such a 4-way junction,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D2/1/code.py:47:#     - Bare '+' intersections are visually simpler than the old 5-bracket motif, but requiring at least one exposed crossing keeps the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D2/1/code.py:242:    - The missing crossing markers mean routing must be inferred from connectivity plus travel direction: keep the current heading through plain '+' intersections and pass straight across 9-blocks when the opposite face is available.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D2/1/code.py:387:    \"\"\"Count exposed color-8 '+' intersections with all four orthogonal neighbors also color 8.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/581f7754/28/code.py:57:#    - 不引入任何基于颜色编号的排序、优先级或状态编码；所有推理都来自可见的颜色匹配与空间阻挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/581f7754/28/code.py:563:            if not blocker_cells.intersection(sim[\"impact_cells\"]):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D2/3/code.py:3:# Change: 交叉标记（crossing markers）——垂直管道通过水平管道的交叉处，用一对5号像素标记穿行管道的交叉点前后，表... → 单侧标记转向\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D2/3/code.py:19:#   horizontal arm\". Unmarked intersections stay straight.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D2/3/code.py:26:#   The rule has exactly three locally visible cases at an intersection:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/10/code.py:33:#       * stationary recolored detached piece near the split intersection\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D2/2/code.py:3:# Change: 交叉标记（crossing markers）——垂直管道通过水平管道的交叉处，用一对5号像素标记穿行管道的交叉点前后，表示“直行不转弯”；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D2/2/code.py:9:#    - 本变体把每个中间交叉点改成真正起作用的彩色标记对：在交叉中心左右各放一个同色 marker。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/2/code.py:3:# Name: 射线截断 + 延伸到最近障碍物\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/581f7754/30/code.py:75:#    - The color change is not free-floating recoloring; it appears only at geometric intersections created by\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/64efde09/19/code.py:3:# Name: 面对面碰撞截断射线\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/64efde09/19/code.py:29:#    visible without introducing ambiguous multi-way intersections. Three labeled rows\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/64efde09/12/code.py:18:#    - 若把两个 sprite 做成互相垂直, 3 条水平射线和 3 条竖直射线会产生大量交叉点, 很容易\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/19/code.py:35:#   - Rotating the whole visible branch would create self-intersections if nearby geometry\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/64efde09/4/code.py:35:# - A fully free placement would create many accidental ray intersections, so the generator uses\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/64efde09/23/code.py:34:#   - conflict: active 边拥有更低 peak，但另一边 distinct 更少，用来暴露优先级。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/64efde09/23/code.py:47:#   - 这样在少量样例中可以看出：不是原题的“更整齐边”，也不是单纯“颜色种类最少边”，而是有优先级的双判据。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D3/1/code.py:42:#      whose degree inside the track component is <= 2. Shared intersections are\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/64efde09/22/code.py:63:#   - Because the new rays can be tangent to the long edge, ray intersections are more likely than\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b0039139/6/code.py:44:#    - Each band intersection contains exactly one component; generator places one blob in\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/71e489b6/11/code.py:26:#    - This combo takes the intersection of \"single-pixel defect\" and\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/71e489b6/37/code.py:3:# Name: 层级优先级处理+大小编码颜色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D6/1/code.py:33:#     - 每张图仍保留 3-6 条真实通道，且至少 2 条路径被步数上限截断，至少 1 条在拐弯后才被截断，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D14/1/code.py:24:#       - plain crossings are now literal \"+\" intersections of 8-cells\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D14/1/code.py:357:      must read the 8-network topologically: go straight through + intersections, and treat maximal\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D14/1/code.py:4:# 这里改为“右上角/右下角角落调色板编码走廊优先级”；当交叉口同时存在多个合法 90° 转弯时，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D14/1/code.py:337:def _count_priority_sensitive_paths(grid: np.ndarray, rows: list[int]) -> int:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D14/1/code.py:442:    if _count_priority_sensitive_paths(g, active_rows) < fork_target:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/67e490f4/17/code.py:98:#       intersection is meaningful; generator now enforces at least 4 distinct samples.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/67e490f4/17/code.py:193:    shared = set.intersection(*color_sets)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/d59b0160/D1/3/code.py:50:# - The only solver-side semantic change is replacing subset inclusion with an intersection-count\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/26/code.py:281:    \"\"\"Return aligned canvas/composite slices for the visible intersection.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/30/code.py:22:#    - 如果允许 3xN 条带再被边界截断成 2xN，可辨识度会明显下降。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/38007d