mposite slices for the visible intersection.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D1/0/code.py:26:#   at the intersection: the old task bends, this variant leaves an orthogonal cross\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D1/0/code.py:48:#   hole inside a plus-shaped intersection, which differentiates the variant from both\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D1/0/code.py:306:    - When a horizontal ray and a vertical ray meet, the intersection cell is cleared back to background and both rays keep moving straight through that 1-cell hole.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D18/1/code.py:28:# - Diagonal geometric crossings follow the same idea: there is no painted intersection cell, but the involved\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D1/1/code.py:35:#     - Original solver could safely ignore self-intersections because a straight beam terminated at the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/38/code.py:44:#   across examples and infer that path detours no longer define priority.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/1/code.py:23:#     - 因此样例里必须稳定出现“射线被已有前景提前截断”的情况。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/1/code.py:36:#     - 每个样例至少有 1 条射线在到达边界前被前景截断，这个是 D6 的定量可见证据。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/1/code.py:37:#     - 因为每个块颜色唯一、每块只发 1 条射线，所以人眼可以直接把“某个颜色块”和“它那条被截断的射线”对应起来。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D3/2/code.py:25:#         create a blank intersection and turn into the bisector; 45-degree\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D3/2/code.py:32:#       - before: a red beam and a blue beam collide at 90 degrees, the intersection\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D3/2/code.py:34:#       - after: the same collision leaves the intersection blank, but the outgoing\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D3/2/code.py:613:    - Ray geometry is unchanged: 90-degree cell collisions leave a blank intersection and turn into the bisector, while 45-degree collisions merge into the same zigzag continuation.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D14/2/code.py:19:#       一次碰撞后形成的新方向会获得局部优先级，先连续推进，直到撞上第三束射线或到边界。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D14/2/code.py:569:    - A first collision creates a priority sub-system whose redirected heads can cause a second visible turn, so output shape depends on iterative collision order rather than only on static intersection geometry.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/2/code.py:30:#       这比原题略低，但仍足够覆盖 2-8 个被搬运源，并保留排序/截断行为。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D20/0/code.py:3:# Change: solver 按优先级尝试六种规则，选择第一个匹配的；某些规则有额外得分偏好（如 fill 偏好像素增加的方向）... → 需消歧的多规则匹配\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b10624e5/D13/2/code.py:107:    \"\"\"Return the unique full-row/full-col divider intersection.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/16de56c4/D19/2/code.py:17:    - 保留原题的“每条射线线段由两个同色 marker 决定周期、aligned companion 决定截断范围、unaligned bystander 保持不变”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/16de56c4/D19/2/code.py:24:    - 变体里同一条线仍然从 10 和 7 读出步长=3，仍然用 4 作为截断端点，但若该线的 control cell 是颜色 2，则输出改为用颜色 2 填充 4/7/10。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b10624e5/D10/0/code.py:93:    \"\"\"Return the unique full-row/full-col divider intersection.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/f560132c/D16/0/code.py:3:# Change: 矩形被分为4个象限，分割线为一条水平线和一条垂直线交叉（十字分割），但交叉点可以偏离中心... → 对角线分割\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/f560132c/D16/0/code.py:30:#    examples. The generator varies the diagonal intersection by shifting the sector boundaries, which\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b10624e5/D15/2/code.py:40:#    - The sink anchor position is chosen from the intersection of all source-fit constraints, and a\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D13/1/code.py:309:            # 90°: remove intersection cell and turn both to the bisector direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D13/1/code.py:316:            # Ensure the intersection cell is permanently blank (gap).\n/home/lixinyu/snap