col 0（左网格边缘），嵌入在path区段中；初始方向优先级为R,D... → 箭头形状标记编码初始方向\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/195c6913/D4/4/code.py:18:#   recovered the initial direction by probing path neighbors in fixed priority\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7ed72f31/D11/1/code.py:38:#         intersection so the whole object is one 4-connected component.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7ed72f31/D11/1/code.py:45:#         arms are present, classify as a cross centered at their intersection.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/1ae2feb7/D5/3/code.py:33:    - bars.sort(key=(dist,row,c0)) 依赖“处理优先级由与分隔条距离决定”; 该机制仍是规则核心.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/1ae2feb7/D9/1/code.py:43:#      的距离”作为首要优先级，只新增一个固定的左右并列 tie-break，避免出现不确定覆盖。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/64efde09/D5/0/code.py:34:# - To avoid orthogonal long-ray intersections introduced by the new stop rule, the generator\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/1ae2feb7/D3/0/code.py:42:- 原来按“离分隔条距离”排序是为了解决同一行 1-2 个色条的覆盖优先级。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5961cc34/D12/0/code.py:45:#    The same occupancy, dilation, and ray-intersection checks keep blobs separated and stop\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/1ae2feb7/D1/1/code.py:30:#   变体仍保留这一优先级，因为双向延伸也会在 bar_side 发生冲突。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/1ae2feb7/D4/0/code.py:27:# - 让不同活跃行的障碍位置变化，并且每个活跃行都真的截断至少一个本可继续出现的周期点；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/64efde09/D3/2/code.py:34:#     - 原 generator 把标记放在边界，隐含“长度 = 到边界的剩余空间”。变体后若继续这样做且还想让三种颜色长度不同，会迫使标记来自不同精灵并频繁截断别的精灵，所以必须放宽为“边界或边界内”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/dfadab01/D10/1/code.py:3:# Change: 标记间距足够大，字形之间通常不重叠；若发生边缘裁剪则简单截断... → 重叠区域标记为特殊颜色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a395ee82/D9/0/code.py:22:#   - 当某个单例恰好落在未来某个 stamp 的像素上时，输出会在 stamp 内部留下一个优先级更高的异色点。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/20270e3b/D13/0/code.py:4:#   → 允许部分body重叠（叠加优先级）：plug 的 body 可以与 base 的 body 重叠，且 plug 覆盖 base。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/20270e3b/D13/1/code.py:53:#      erase body-body intersections, so those cells must be intercepted first.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/20270e3b/D13/1/code.py:62:#      intersection and no extension above/left of the base.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/64efde09/D7/0/code.py:45:#    - quiet-side 约束让裁剪窗口与原始画布边界之间留下整洁留白, 输出不会看上去像随机截断.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7666fa5d/D14/2/code.py:75:      - each chosen control pixel is one of the two border intersections of that segment's\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a32d8b75/D12/0/code.py:25:#    intersection is painted. Example: if a 24x12 composite is anchored at the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a32d8b75/D12/0/code.py:257:    \"\"\"Return aligned canvas/composite slices for the visible intersection.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/58f5dbd5/D17/0/code.py:28:#    intersections, while motifs occupy the remaining 5x3 / 3x5 / 3x3 cells.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/409aa875/D14/2/code.py:3:# Change: 任意两个精灵之间 Chebyshev 距离 >= 2（不可8-连通相邻）... → 间距编码优先级\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D2/0/code.py:237:    common_colors = set.intersection(*(cand[\"colors\"] for cand in legend_candidates))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D2/1/code.py:194:    shared = set.intersection(*(set(tile[\"colors\"]) for tile in legend_tiles))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4a21e3da/D5/0/code.py:26:#     the formerly disappearing quadrant now remains near the split intersection and turns green\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D11/1/code.py:42:#      intersection with the interior is 4-connected, non-empty, and still spans the full\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D11/1/code.py:366:    \"\"\"Return valid slot boxes whose intersection with the irregular interior stays bbox-sized.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4a21e3da/D16/1/code.py:21:      - 唯一变化: 原先“消失”的象限不再删除, 而是滑向分割线交叉点附近的内角:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4a21e3da/D16/1/code.py:47:    - 该块保留在 split 交叉点旁边, 与“去角落”的其他片段形成稳定对比, 2-3 个样例即可观察到。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4a21e3da/D16/1/code.py:140:    unique non-touching quadrant under two controls, to the split intersection.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/aa4ec2a5/D7/1/code.py:32:#     - 若对象需要 L 层轮廓, 它离网格边缘至少要有 L 格, 否则外层会被截断.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4a21e3da/D9/0/code.py:34:#         - an intersection pixel, if it existed, would belong to all four quadrants\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D4/1/code.py:13:#      every top marker of that color projects vertically into the frame, and their intersections are\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D4/1/code.py:135:    - For each source color, take every same-color row marker and every same-color column marker; their projected intersections are the sprite destinations.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/581f7754/D4/1/code.py:3:# Change: 边界上的孤立单像素（非角落），4-邻域均为背景色，1-3个不同颜色锚点... → 内部锚点（十字线交叉点）\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
